    <td style="background-color: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; font-size: 11pt; vertical-align: top;">JSON: <code style="font-family: Consolas;">UserProfileDto</code></td>
    <td style="background-color: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; font-size: 11pt; vertical-align: top;">Khách hàng</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; font-size: 11pt; vertical-align: top;"><code style="font-family: Consolas;">GET</code></td>
    <td style="background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; font-size: 11pt; vertical-align: top;"><code style="font-family: Consolas;">/api/customer/addresses</code></td>
    <td style="background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; font-size: 11pt; vertical-align: top;">Lấy danh sách sổ địa chỉ của khách</td>
    <td style="background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; font-size: 11pt; vertical-align: top;">Header: <code style="font-family: Consolas;">Authorization Bearer <JWT></code></td>
    <td style="background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; font-size: 11pt; vertical-align: top;">JSON: <code style="font-family: Consolas;">List<UserAddress></code></td>
    <td style="background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; font-size: 11pt; vertical-align: top;">Khách hàng</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="background-color: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; font-size: 11pt; vertical-align: top;"><code style="font-family: Consolas;">POST</code></td>
    <td style="background-color: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; font-size: 11pt; vertical-align: top;"><code style="font-family: Consolas;">/api/customer/addresses</code></td>
    <td style="background-color: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; font-size: 11pt; vertical-align: top;">Thêm mới địa chỉ nhận hàng</td>
    <td style="background-color: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; font-size: 11pt; vertical-align: top;">JSON: <code style="font-family: Consolas;">receiverName, phone, address...</code></td>
    <td style="background-color: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; font-size: 11pt; vertical-align: top;">JSON: <code style="font-family: Consolas;">UserAddress</code></td>
    <td style="background-color: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; font-size: 11pt; vertical-align: top;">Khách hàng</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; font-size: 11pt; vertical-align: top;"><code style="font-family: Consolas;">POST</code></td>
    <td style="background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; font-size: 11pt; vertical-align: top;"><code style="font-family: Consolas;">/api/customer/orders</code></td>
    <td style="background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; font-size: 11pt; vertical-align: top;">Đặt hàng mới (COD hoặc VNPAY)</td>
